OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FFaced with major surgery Tal
OL,7,     FGolesworthy decided to use his
OL,8,     Fengineering skills to fix the
OL,9,     Fpipework around his heart - and
OL,10,     Fhelp hundreds of others with the
OL,11,     Fsame condition.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn June 1987, hundreds of women
OL,14,     Fwalked towards the ceasefire line
OL,15,     Fthat split Cyprus in two, hoping
OL,16,     Fpeaceful protest would bring
OL,17,     Fglobal attention to the division
OL,18,     Fof the country.
